# Magvault camera profile
name: Sony FDR-AX53
id: sony-fdr-ax53

vendor: Sony
model: FDR-AX53
card_layout: PRIVATE/M4ROOT, PRIVATE/AVCHD
filename_pattern: C????.MP4, *.MTS

file_formats: XAVC S 4K, XAVC S HD, AVCHD
default_format: XAVC S 4K

gamma: Rec.709
default_gamma: Rec.709

gamut: Rec.709
default_gamut: Rec.709

typical_resolutions: 3840x2160, 1920x1080, 1440x1080
typical_fps: 24, 25, 30, 50, 60
audio_channels: 2, 6

notes: User may call this FDR-AX3. Firmware writes FDR-AX53. Do not look for the string AX3.
